  "ruleText": "He-W 572.08 Utilization Review and Control. The department shall monitor utilization of ambulance services, in accordance with 42 CFR 455, 42 CFR 456, He-W 520, and He-W 521.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #6641, eff 11-27-97; EXPIRED: 11-27-05\n\nNew. #8502, INTERIM, eff 12-2-05, EXPIRES: 5-31-06; ss by #8638, eff 5-30-06; ss by #10294, eff 12-1-13 (from He-W 572.06); ss by #13840, INTERIM, eff 12-29-23; ss by #14007, eff 6-25-24",
